'''Eternal '''is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife that was released on November 5th, 2016 to promote [[Murder Mystery 2|Murder Mystery 2’s]] merch. It was originally obtainable by purchasing merch from [https://shopmm2.com shopmm2.com]<ref>https://twitter.com/NikilisRBX/status/795052588953694214</ref> and redeeming the promotional code that came with it. It is now only obtainable through trading as the merch has since sold out.

==Appearance==
It has a long, slightly jagged cracked indigo tinged gray blade with a scratched silver edge. The guard is silver with an indigo tinge with curved quillons, two sets of horns by the ricasso, and glowing red eyes. The handle, attached to a silver prong below the guard, is gray with an indigo tinged silver paracord wrap that has glowing red beads on it.

==Trivia== 
*It was the first Eternal knife to be released in [[Murder Mystery 2]]. It was also the first time [[Nikilis]] gave out an exclusive item to players who bought merch in the available timeframe (November 5, 2016 - November 14, 2016).
*It has been a major target in duping.
*It has many following successors which were obtained in similar ways, those being [[Eternal II]], [[Eternal III]], [[Eternal IV]], and as well as the Christmas version [[Eternalcane]].
* Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://web.roblox.com/catalog/532254782/Sword-of-the-Eternal-Abyss Sword of the Eternal Abyss].

